# Slices

Read `docs/slices.md` first. Implement the **lowest incomplete** slice only.

Do not implement a later slice “while you are here”. Do not scaffold tic-tac-toe in this repo.

Done = the tests listed for that slice pass (`engine_tests` / `ctest`). If CMake/submodules are missing, fix slice 0, not gameplay.
